{"reviewId": "380041367_86vyiwDsd", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "🏗️ “固定资产投资”是什么？\n\n就是你一开始要花的钱，比如：\n\n租店面\n\n装修\n\n买炉灶、冰箱、桌椅\n\n修水电\n\n这些东西 贵、一次性、不能马上赚钱，但没有它们，餐厅根本开不起来。\n\n🚀 “工业化起飞阶段”在干嘛？\n\n就是餐厅刚准备开业那几年：\n\n客人还不多\n\n名气还没打出来\n\n但你必须 一次性把基础全铺好\n\n👉 所以你会 疯狂花钱买设备、装修、扩张空间。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "固定资产投资的剧烈膨胀是工业化国家在工业化起飞阶段的共同特征", "range": "1936-1966", "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "380041367_86vyiwDsd", "userVid": 380041367, "topics": [], "createTime": 1769642762, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 380041367, "name": "GR", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0031-P6hqbJRljynfKT9e8iT1yc1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "GR", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240520-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 14, "likes": [{"userVid": 208880611, "name": "芒格r", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/qGusKyb0IEd4Y6TeGUdO1pEr1F1ibKEJW4sgALG80Th8xUibMFYPPbKzLsK7dp5qltajovNpplgbc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M16-7-8", "desc": "微信读书十周年勋章", "title": "微信读书十周年", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "主要还是指工厂的大型设备", "reviewId": "380041367_86vyiwDsd", "commentId": "380041367_86vyi